    "text": "8 hours ago BROWARD COUNTY, Fla. — A 17-year-old boy vanished about 10 days ago on his way to a public park in Hallandale Beach, according to police. George Harper was last seen wearing a gray shirt and black Nike pants at about 6 p.m. on Sept. 28, according to the Hallandale Beach Police Department. Read full article",
